Package: vortex-openclaw
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 22.19), vortex-core
Description: OpenClaw AI agent, vendored and caged for Vortex OS
 Ships a pinned OpenClaw release with its node_modules vendored into
 /opt/openclaw (deterministic, offline-installable), a hardened systemd
 unit running inside vortex.slice with tuned memory limits, and a low-RAM
 config template. The service ships disabled; the first-boot wizard enables
 it once API keys exist.
